WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:44.960 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 3=

02:21.820 --> 02:22.730
Ms. Chen.

02:23.990 --> 02:25.280
Do you think

02:26.570 --> 02:28.690
I'm just not meant for university?

02:30.100 --> 02:32.190
If even that comes down to fate,

02:34.690 --> 02:37.310
then maybe it's not worth going at all.

02:40.500 --> 02:41.850
But when you taught us,

02:41.850 --> 02:43.090
that's not what you said.

02:44.260 --> 02:45.790
If I hadn't read your essays,

02:46.160 --> 02:47.930
I wouldn't have dreamed of literature.

02:48.660 --> 02:51.030
If you hadn't always encouraged us

02:51.030 --> 02:52.410
to study hard,

02:52.540 --> 02:53.890
to go to university,

02:54.290 --> 02:56.730
so we could see
a bigger world out there,

02:57.340 --> 02:58.730
I wouldn't be this stubborn

02:58.730 --> 02:59.670
about getting in.

03:03.360 --> 03:04.500
So now it's on me?

03:15.690 --> 03:16.840
Where there's a will,

03:17.410 --> 03:18.780
there's a way.

03:19.410 --> 03:21.410
Burn your bridges,

03:22.130 --> 03:25.340
and even the Qin strongholds
will fall to Chu.

03:26.820 --> 03:28.410
Heaven rewards...

03:28.410 --> 03:30.780
- those who persevere.
- Heaven rewards those who persevere.

03:30.780 --> 03:32.660
Endure hardship,

03:32.660 --> 03:35.570
and three thousand
Yue soldiers can conquer Wu.

03:42.340 --> 03:44.820
The world's changing too fast.

03:44.820 --> 03:46.340
These days, I don't even know

03:46.730 --> 03:49.460
if pushing you
toward university back then

03:51.380 --> 03:54.260
was right or wrong.

03:55.610 --> 03:56.410
Either way,

03:56.980 --> 03:58.730
you were the only one

03:58.730 --> 04:00.060
who supported me going.

04:01.540 --> 04:03.410
Whenever I started to lose faith,

04:03.410 --> 04:04.660
you kept encouraging me.

04:05.450 --> 04:06.570
So please,

04:07.450 --> 04:08.890
you can't waver now.

04:14.130 --> 04:14.780
Alright.

04:16.460 --> 04:17.930
Then I'll be

04:18.660 --> 04:19.950
a pine tree

04:20.810 --> 04:21.900
on the highest peak,

04:22.730 --> 04:24.080
always standing behind you.

04:33.970 --> 04:35.240
Rehabilitation Plan.

04:35.840 --> 04:36.490
First,

04:37.170 --> 04:38.370
physical exercise.

04:38.370 --> 04:40.100
Daily walks and sun exposure.

04:40.860 --> 04:44.340
Second, memory training.
Read the newspaper every day.

04:44.340 --> 04:46.190
(Rehabilitation Plan)
Finish one book a week.

04:46.320 --> 04:48.250
Third, improve nutrition.

04:48.560 --> 04:50.520
At least one meal
of refined grains a day.

04:50.730 --> 04:52.100
Meat once every two weeks.

04:52.420 --> 04:52.960
Fei Ni.

04:53.790 --> 04:54.990
What are you doing up so late?

04:55.250 --> 04:56.250
Who are you talking to?

04:56.930 --> 04:58.650
I'm just reading.

04:58.650 --> 04:59.880
Go to sleep.

05:00.004 --> 05:00.950
Don't stay up too late.

05:08.780 --> 05:09.410
Forget it.

05:11.370 --> 05:13.690
Meat once a week...

05:16.490 --> 05:17.860
And fruit.

05:18.060 --> 05:20.420
(Meat and fruit once a week)

05:42.290 --> 05:45.860
(This money has to be sent
to my brother every month.)

05:46.100 --> 05:47.170
(I can't touch it.)

05:49.960 --> 05:52.450
(This is the family's
monthly living expenses.)

05:54.982 --> 05:56.190
(I can't touch this either.)

05:59.137 --> 05:59.900
(University Fund)

05:59.900 --> 06:00.930
(Definitely not.)

06:01.610 --> 06:03.610
(I've saved this for three years.)

06:03.715 --> 06:06.420
(It's for my parents' living expenses
once I get into university.)

06:06.420 --> 06:07.810
(I absolutely cannot touch it.)

06:08.690 --> 06:11.490
(But meat and supplements cost money.)

06:12.100 --> 06:14.420
(Should I borrow some from Ms. Xu?)

06:14.860 --> 06:15.860
(No. No. No.)

06:16.230 --> 06:18.100
(I can't ask the superior for money...)

06:18.100 --> 06:19.520
(If word gets out later,)

06:19.520 --> 06:20.930
(my commendation will be gone.)

06:23.210 --> 06:24.300
(What am I going to do...)

06:29.090 --> 06:31.471
(University Fund)
(This time, I'll have to dip into it.)

06:31.537 --> 06:33.860
(Otherwise Fang Muyang will really
be taken by his sister.)

06:33.860 --> 06:35.610
(And my chance at university is gone!)

07:05.900 --> 07:07.370
Fang Muyang.

07:07.370 --> 07:10.420
You have to get better this time.

07:16.060 --> 07:17.780
(Inpatient Department)

07:17.780 --> 07:18.630
Fang Muyang.

07:19.150 --> 07:20.810
Can you come down first?

07:21.760 --> 07:23.580
Whatever you want, just tell me.

07:25.220 --> 07:25.950
Come down first.

07:26.560 --> 07:27.648
I'm waiting for Fei Ni.

07:27.830 --> 07:29.160
It's always about Fei Ni.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.110
Is that all you know?

07:30.110 --> 07:31.471
Does Fei Ni owe you something?

07:31.800 --> 07:33.120
Cut it out.

07:33.860 --> 07:35.280
Alright, don't move!

07:35.280 --> 07:37.660
I'll go get Fei Ni. Just don't move.

07:37.660 --> 07:39.448
- I'll go find Fei Ni for you.
- Fang Muyang!

07:40.340 --> 07:41.810
Come down now.

07:42.870 --> 07:43.510
Fei Ni!

07:44.020 --> 07:45.340
Why are you sitting up there?

07:45.460 --> 07:46.310
Quick, come down.

07:47.170 --> 07:47.730
Hurry.

07:50.010 --> 07:50.930
What's going on?

07:52.770 --> 07:53.630
She's taking me away.

07:58.400 --> 07:59.090
I don't know her.

08:07.760 --> 08:08.660
You're still smiling?

08:09.520 --> 08:10.370
That was dangerous.

08:10.471 --> 08:10.980
Come here.

08:11.730 --> 08:12.980
I'll talk to her, alright?

08:12.980 --> 08:14.200
Sit here.

08:14.590 --> 08:16.540
Head Nurse,
could you watch him for a bit?

08:16.540 --> 08:17.420
Alright.

08:17.420 --> 08:19.220
- Go on, we've got him.
- Okay.

08:19.660 --> 08:20.800
Don't go up the window ledge.

09:20.693 --> 09:22.820
(Rehabilitation Plan)
This is the recovery plan

09:22.820 --> 09:24.537
I've prepared for Fang Muyang.

09:25.870 --> 09:26.770
Dr. Liang said

09:27.580 --> 09:29.400
he's only lost his memory.

09:29.400 --> 09:31.180
His cognitive ability is fine.

09:31.560 --> 09:32.540
So I'll start

09:32.540 --> 09:34.450
by teaching him basic life skills,

09:34.450 --> 09:36.780
(Rehabilitation Plan)
until he can take care of himself.

09:37.650 --> 09:40.680
If he regains his memory along the way,

09:41.040 --> 09:41.950
that would be ideal.

09:42.180 --> 09:43.390
But if he doesn't,

09:44.382 --> 09:46.226
he'll still be able to live normally.

09:47.250 --> 09:48.100
So,

09:49.240 --> 09:51.060
could you not send him
to a sanatorium?

09:52.160 --> 09:52.810
I know

09:54.760 --> 09:55.730
you can't bear to either.

09:59.120 --> 10:01.100
Do you see me
the same way the other nurses do?

10:01.370 --> 10:02.690
Like I'm cold-blooded?

10:04.070 --> 10:05.580
You have your own difficulties, too.

10:06.610 --> 10:08.080
Honestly, I admire you.

10:09.930 --> 10:11.120
If it were someone else,

10:11.960 --> 10:13.110
they might not be as...

10:13.460 --> 10:14.180
clear-headed.

10:15.700 --> 10:16.470
Clear-headed?

10:18.080 --> 10:19.370
You mean selfish.

10:19.540 --> 10:21.315
There's nothing wrong with that.

10:22.370 --> 10:24.210
You've already done the best you can

10:24.450 --> 10:25.460
within your means.

10:26.240 --> 10:27.130
No one has the right

10:27.130 --> 10:29.570
to ask you to sacrifice yourself
for someone else.

10:31.090 --> 10:32.350
Not even your own brother.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.270
Then what about you?

10:36.060 --> 10:38.370
Why are you willing
to give up your time

10:38.520 --> 10:39.700
to look after him?

10:42.060 --> 10:43.840
It's not a sacrifice. I...

10:44.640 --> 10:45.760
I truly admire...

10:47.610 --> 10:49.700
Fang Muyang.

10:49.980 --> 10:51.060
So don't worry.

10:51.250 --> 10:53.420
I'll take the best possible care of him.

10:57.690 --> 10:58.730
My brother...

10:58.900 --> 11:00.650
He's never done
anything to be proud of.

11:01.400 --> 11:03.026
And now he's become a hero.

11:08.510 --> 11:09.640
I'm counting on you.

11:12.980 --> 11:18.660
(Jiangcheng)

11:21.860 --> 11:23.250
Excuse me. Passing through.

11:25.890 --> 11:27.300
Excuse me. Passing through.

11:36.280 --> 11:36.980
Comrade.

11:38.204 --> 11:39.140
- Thanks.
- Excuse me.

11:39.140 --> 11:40.610
Alright. Comrade.

11:42.100 --> 11:44.060
Hello, that's my seat.

11:44.700 --> 11:47.026
Hey, watch your hands.

11:48.370 --> 11:49.300
Please move.

11:49.300 --> 11:50.640
That's my seat.

11:51.540 --> 11:52.770
You're funny.

11:52.770 --> 11:55.180
On a train, whoever sits first owns it.

11:55.370 --> 11:56.580
Since when is it yours?

11:59.610 --> 12:00.860
It is my seat.

12:00.860 --> 12:02.140
There's a seat number on it.

12:05.180 --> 12:06.070
Not anymore.

12:12.650 --> 12:14.010
Get up.

12:14.180 --> 12:15.010
You... you...

12:15.010 --> 12:16.010
Thug.

12:16.700 --> 12:17.650
People like you

12:17.650 --> 12:19.680
have no morals, no shame.

12:20.010 --> 12:22.410
(Qu Hua)
All you do is bully the weak.

12:22.410 --> 12:24.350
If the one sitting here today
were a six-foot man,

12:24.350 --> 12:25.410
would you still dare?

12:25.410 --> 12:26.880
How can a scum like you

12:26.880 --> 12:28.090
even get to live in this world?

12:28.090 --> 12:30.000
You're worse than a toad in a cesspit.

12:30.000 --> 12:31.700
At least a toad eats pests!

12:31.700 --> 12:32.410
But you?

12:32.410 --> 12:34.580
You're like flies, mosquitoes,
and bedbugs!

12:34.580 --> 12:35.780
All you do is disgust people

12:35.780 --> 12:37.010
and waste resources.

12:37.010 --> 12:38.860
What gives you the right?

12:39.650 --> 12:40.690
How do people like you

12:41.290 --> 12:41.950
get to

12:41.950 --> 12:43.490
run around

12:43.490 --> 12:44.700
bullying people?

12:44.700 --> 12:47.250
(He has never harmed anyone,)

12:47.370 --> 12:49.460
(yet he has to suffer like that!)

12:49.820 --> 12:50.830
Why?

12:51.820 --> 12:53.410
How dare you hit me?

12:53.410 --> 12:55.650
Hey, don't yell at her!

12:59.650 --> 13:00.890
Everyone saw that.

13:00.890 --> 13:01.820
I didn't touch her.

13:01.820 --> 13:02.890
I didn't do anything!

13:03.700 --> 13:04.820
Make way, please.

13:04.820 --> 13:05.410
Make way.

13:05.410 --> 13:06.740
I'm a doctor. Please move aside.

13:07.010 --> 13:08.120
Keep the air flowing.

13:08.120 --> 13:09.100
Make way, please.

13:33.820 --> 13:34.671
You're awake.

13:36.560 --> 13:37.300
Who are you?

13:41.000 --> 13:42.010
How did I end up here?

13:44.720 --> 13:45.560
I'm a doctor.

13:45.871 --> 13:47.130
Your blood sugar was too low.

13:47.500 --> 13:49.220
And you got overly agitated just now.

13:49.380 --> 13:50.220
So, you fainted.

13:50.710 --> 13:51.950
But it's nothing serious.

13:52.380 --> 13:55.230
Have some sugar and get proper rest.

13:56.820 --> 13:57.770
Thank you.

14:01.110 --> 14:02.860
This is my berth.

14:03.180 --> 14:04.280
You can lie here.

14:04.610 --> 14:06.360
I'll go sit in your seat later.

14:07.250 --> 14:08.220
I can't do that.

14:08.220 --> 14:09.940
Treating patients is my responsibility.

14:10.160 --> 14:11.580
You need to rest right now.

14:11.580 --> 14:13.180
I can't take advantage of you.

14:13.760 --> 14:15.740
Besides, you said I'm fine.

14:17.490 --> 14:19.026
If you insist on leaving,

14:19.071 --> 14:20.271
(Biscuits)
have this.

14:28.220 --> 14:30.160
I'm getting off at the next stop.

14:30.540 --> 14:32.240
I've already spoken to the conductor.

14:32.880 --> 14:34.370
He'll come find you later

14:34.370 --> 14:36.000
to top up the sleeper ticket

14:37.200 --> 14:38.730
for the rest of your journey.

14:58.060 --> 14:58.680
No need.

15:07.970 --> 15:08.690
Thank you.

15:16.700 --> 15:17.790
You study mathematics?

15:24.770 --> 15:25.770
When you fainted earlier,

15:25.770 --> 15:27.280
while I was carrying you up,

15:27.280 --> 15:29.370
the things in your bag fell out.

15:29.370 --> 15:31.460
(Jiangcheng University Staff ID)

15:44.300 --> 15:45.250
Get some proper rest.

15:45.350 --> 15:46.380
I'll leave you be.

16:10.730 --> 16:12.560
(Director Wu, I've made up my mind.)

16:13.450 --> 16:14.560
I'm going to cut ties

16:14.560 --> 16:16.293
with my “Black Five
Categories” parents.

16:16.560 --> 16:18.840
These are all the letters and photos

16:18.840 --> 16:19.700
they sent me.

16:20.390 --> 16:21.550
Please trust

16:21.582 --> 16:23.693
(Professor Wu)
my loyalty to the revolutionary cause.

16:23.830 --> 16:24.980
And please believe

16:25.390 --> 16:27.220
that I'm willing to devote my life

16:27.220 --> 16:28.648
to our nation's mathematics.

16:30.320 --> 16:32.780
I'm applying
to remain at the university.

16:34.160 --> 16:35.390
Even doing odd jobs is fine.

17:40.140 --> 17:43.460
(Advanced Mathematics)

17:50.960 --> 17:53.100
I heard from your sister
that you like drawing.

17:53.100 --> 17:54.230
I bought these for you.

17:56.420 --> 17:59.900
(Colored Pencils)

18:01.260 --> 18:02.980
(Watercolors)

18:10.770 --> 18:13.060
(Fang Muyang never stuck
with anything growing up.)

18:13.540 --> 18:14.920
Except for drawing.

18:14.920 --> 18:16.500
He's kept at it all these years.

18:16.760 --> 18:17.610
If possible,

18:17.610 --> 18:19.020
get him a sketchbook.

18:19.490 --> 18:21.450
It might help his memory recover sooner.

18:25.780 --> 18:26.410
Thank you.

18:27.250 --> 18:27.840
Fei Ni.

18:28.500 --> 18:30.000
Use them sparingly.

18:30.090 --> 18:31.990
These art supplies aren't cheap.

18:33.610 --> 18:36.080
When I saw your sister off
at the station,

18:36.080 --> 18:38.004
she left you a hundred yuan.

18:39.980 --> 18:40.890
Can you manage money?

18:48.260 --> 18:49.040
Forget it.

18:49.780 --> 18:51.950
I'll hold onto it for you.

18:51.950 --> 18:53.120
In case you get scammed again.

18:53.580 --> 18:56.093
Don't worry, I won't spend a cent of it.

18:57.770 --> 18:58.560
If you like it,

18:59.004 --> 19:00.137
it's all yours.

19:00.340 --> 19:01.560
Don't talk nonsense.

19:02.260 --> 19:04.110
Taking advantage of a hero?

19:04.510 --> 19:05.700
You could get me into trouble.

19:06.410 --> 19:06.920
Alright.

19:07.760 --> 19:08.550
No more nonsense.

19:11.690 --> 19:12.740
Anyway,

19:13.390 --> 19:14.170
if there's anything

19:14.340 --> 19:16.930
you feel like eating, just tell me.

19:17.050 --> 19:18.410
I'll take good care of you.

19:18.650 --> 19:20.720
But you've got to try hard
to remember the past.

19:21.190 --> 19:23.680
When your sister comes again,
you have to tell her

19:24.160 --> 19:26.040
I've been taking good care of you.

19:27.430 --> 19:27.820
Sure.

19:37.020 --> 19:40.900
(Jiangnan Station)

19:47.460 --> 19:48.170
Hello.

19:49.310 --> 19:50.780
The conductor never came.

19:50.900 --> 19:53.180
So I figured
you didn't get off early after all.

19:56.580 --> 19:57.580
This is the sleeper fare.

20:02.300 --> 20:02.960
Thank you.

20:13.920 --> 20:14.960
Watch and learn.

20:16.190 --> 20:17.410
Cut along this line.

20:18.940 --> 20:20.860
Don't go past it.

20:21.050 --> 20:22.240
Or you'll bleed.

20:30.140 --> 20:31.550
There, one nail done.

20:34.810 --> 20:35.300
Not hard.

20:35.740 --> 20:36.600
Your turn.

20:39.320 --> 20:40.020
Slowly.

20:40.330 --> 20:40.780
Okay.

20:50.271 --> 20:51.382
What are you doing?

20:52.640 --> 20:53.040
You...

20:53.137 --> 20:54.040
What are you doing?

20:54.248 --> 20:55.340
I'm helping you cut them.

21:08.970 --> 21:10.230
Did you do that on purpose?

21:12.820 --> 21:15.220
Did you remember
I cut your finger before,

21:15.680 --> 21:17.500
so this is payback?

21:18.620 --> 21:19.360
I don't remember.

21:23.020 --> 21:23.780
It's okay.

21:24.910 --> 21:25.650
Take it slow.

21:26.590 --> 21:27.580
From now on,

21:27.580 --> 21:29.700
I'm going to teach you
basic life skills.

21:30.040 --> 21:32.080
Brushing your teeth,
washing your hair and face,

21:32.080 --> 21:34.640
tying your shoelaces,
mending clothes, and doing laundry.

21:34.640 --> 21:37.040
You'll have to
learn to do all these yourself.

21:39.380 --> 21:40.630
There's a reward if you do well.

21:52.270 --> 21:53.520
Pull it up.

22:06.060 --> 22:07.170
Nicely brushed.

22:07.170 --> 22:08.760
- Braised pork.
- Deal.

22:14.110 --> 22:15.780
All neat and tidy.

22:15.780 --> 22:18.137
Fang Muyang, how do you learn so fast?

22:18.310 --> 22:18.880
Pork cutlet.

22:21.120 --> 22:22.130
We don't have that.

22:22.271 --> 22:23.804
Deda Western Restaurant does.

22:26.330 --> 22:27.520
Did you remember something?

22:28.080 --> 22:29.800
The pork cutlet
at Deda Western Restaurant,

22:29.800 --> 22:31.690
the ice cream and borscht,
Yuhua Restaurant's meatballs,

22:31.690 --> 22:33.250
and the beef noodles
on Shangcheng Street.

22:33.260 --> 22:34.720
Why is it all food?

22:34.720 --> 22:36.310
Didn't you remember anything else?

22:39.100 --> 22:40.020
The train station.

22:42.340 --> 22:43.660
What about the train station?

22:48.804 --> 22:50.580
The brown sugar
pancakes they sell there.

22:51.471 --> 22:53.980
Fang Muyang, you're exactly
the same as when you were little.

22:53.980 --> 22:55.410
All you think about is food.

22:55.770 --> 22:56.740
I'll tell my sister

22:56.782 --> 22:58.448
you've been taking great care of me.

23:00.060 --> 23:00.690
Alright.

23:01.100 --> 23:01.780
(University Fund)

23:07.040 --> 23:08.450
(Madam Xu)
Hello, your pork cutlet.

23:09.900 --> 23:10.490
Thank you.

23:11.600 --> 23:12.340
You're welcome.

23:14.040 --> 23:14.820
I'm not eating it.

23:17.070 --> 23:17.740
Braised pork.

23:17.804 --> 23:19.240
Beef noodles from Shangcheng Street.

23:22.300 --> 23:24.580
Yuhua Restaurant's meatballs,
and borscht.

23:31.970 --> 23:33.410
Washed up nice and clean.

23:34.020 --> 23:34.860
Coffee.

23:35.860 --> 23:36.580
Co-what?

23:36.950 --> 23:37.580
Hello.

23:38.000 --> 23:39.140
You sure you want coffee

23:39.140 --> 23:40.830
served in this enamel mug?

23:40.830 --> 23:41.650
Yes.

23:55.070 --> 23:55.610
Impressive.

23:56.190 --> 23:57.300
I pricked my hand.

23:58.370 --> 24:00.690
It's fine.
I'll put some antiseptic on it later.

24:01.890 --> 24:02.520
Red...

24:03.780 --> 24:04.550
Remember something?

24:05.670 --> 24:06.693
Red wine.

24:07.580 --> 24:08.290
What?

24:08.890 --> 24:10.060
I want red wine.

24:10.300 --> 24:13.420
(Fang Mujing, 100 yuan)

24:16.982 --> 24:19.004
I said I wouldn't spend a cent,
and I won't.

24:19.590 --> 24:20.800
It's not like I'd cheat him.

24:22.400 --> 24:24.160
I can earn it back.

24:41.830 --> 24:42.930
One yuan a bottle.

24:43.210 --> 24:43.890
That's right.

24:49.782 --> 24:50.890
I don't want it anymore.

25:31.780 --> 25:32.650
So salty and spicy.

25:34.080 --> 25:34.960
Maybe...

25:35.850 --> 25:37.970
the grapes weren't great this year.
Just make do.

25:38.140 --> 25:38.860
I'm off to work.

25:39.160 --> 25:40.030
I want to hear music.

25:40.480 --> 25:42.640
Fang Muyang, don't push it.

25:42.640 --> 25:43.930
I'll tell my sister

25:44.382 --> 25:46.115
you've been taking great care of me.

25:49.020 --> 25:49.930
Just one minute.

26:20.760 --> 26:21.940
Have him take his medicine.

26:21.940 --> 26:22.210
Okay.

26:27.980 --> 26:28.860
Take your medicine.

26:40.960 --> 26:41.650
You're leaving?

26:42.850 --> 26:44.450
Yeah, heading home for dinner.

26:44.626 --> 26:45.920
I've got the night shift later.

26:47.140 --> 26:48.860
Can you help trim my nails again?

26:49.850 --> 26:50.280
I...

26:51.520 --> 26:51.890
I...

26:52.470 --> 26:53.980
Didn't I already teach you?

26:53.980 --> 26:55.300
You learned it.

26:55.480 --> 26:56.820
I forgot again.

26:58.140 --> 26:59.300
I've been biting them off.

27:05.650 --> 27:06.540
Alright, alright.

27:06.540 --> 27:08.370
Stop biting. Sit down.

27:09.490 --> 27:10.530
Take your medicine first.

27:19.430 --> 27:20.270
Look.

27:20.760 --> 27:22.820
Just don't go past this line.

27:23.410 --> 27:24.580
Or it'll bleed.

27:26.080 --> 27:27.890
See? It comes right off.

27:31.940 --> 27:34.260
Cut along here. See that?

27:38.990 --> 27:39.750
Fang Muyang.

27:42.230 --> 27:43.610
Fang Muyang, look at me.

27:44.070 --> 27:44.870
Turn around.

27:48.440 --> 27:49.520
Are you tricking me?

27:49.520 --> 27:50.650
You already know how.

27:50.650 --> 27:52.182
You just wanted me to do it for you.

27:55.300 --> 27:55.860
Yes.

28:01.410 --> 28:04.480
Don't think that just because
I buy you food and drinks,

28:04.480 --> 28:06.560
and art supplies, it's a given.

28:06.560 --> 28:09.010
From now on, every bit of effort
I put in for you

28:09.010 --> 28:10.020
comes with a price.

28:10.710 --> 28:12.060
Everything I've done,

28:13.293 --> 28:14.404
I'll let it slide.

28:14.850 --> 28:17.880
From today onward, it's fixed rates.

28:18.800 --> 28:19.490
Actually,

28:20.210 --> 28:21.670
things like trimming nails,

28:21.670 --> 28:22.790
tidying clothes,

28:22.790 --> 28:24.480
these don't really cost anything.

28:24.480 --> 28:26.010
I shouldn't be charging you for them.

28:26.170 --> 28:28.440
It's also a task
assigned to me by the factory.

28:28.440 --> 28:29.240
But,

28:29.500 --> 28:31.370
if I teach you more than three times

28:31.370 --> 28:32.400
and you still can't learn,

28:32.400 --> 28:33.780
then I'll charge per session.

28:35.200 --> 28:37.880
Also, when you buy
sketchbooks and art supplies,

28:37.880 --> 28:40.150
or anything you want to eat,
like fried pork cutlet,

28:40.480 --> 28:41.580
coffee,

28:41.850 --> 28:42.770
or wine,

28:42.770 --> 28:44.500
it all gets deducted
from the hundred yuan.

28:44.780 --> 28:45.540
Agreed?

28:54.110 --> 28:54.940
Look here.

28:55.450 --> 28:57.370
Nail trimming, clothes tidying,

28:57.370 --> 28:59.190
(Fee Schedule)
shaving, three cents each time.

29:00.370 --> 29:03.100
Hair washing, sponge baths,
laundry, sewing buttons,

29:03.100 --> 29:04.170
ten cents each time.

29:04.340 --> 29:06.260
Food, drink, clothing,
and daily expenses

29:06.582 --> 29:07.915
are reimbursed as spent.

29:08.980 --> 29:10.260
You nodded just now.

29:10.800 --> 29:12.540
Sign here.

29:14.940 --> 29:17.140
(Both Parties Sign)

29:17.970 --> 29:18.890
The name.

29:20.210 --> 29:21.170
How do I write it?

29:42.080 --> 29:42.800
Nail trimming.

29:49.630 --> 29:50.580
I'm charging you now.

29:51.880 --> 29:52.460
Go ahead.

29:54.100 --> 29:54.570
Okay.

29:59.060 --> 30:00.320
Speaking of money,

30:00.320 --> 30:01.580
I just remembered.

30:01.730 --> 30:04.390
You still owed me money
back in middle school.

30:04.740 --> 30:05.260
Don't run.

30:05.260 --> 30:08.380
(Six Years Earlier)

30:14.210 --> 30:16.650
Fei Ni, I've got no money for food.

30:16.650 --> 30:17.680
Lend me some?

30:18.780 --> 30:20.870
Don't your family give you money?

30:25.780 --> 30:27.130
How much do you want?

30:27.360 --> 30:28.430
How much do you have?

30:36.690 --> 30:37.390
This little?

30:37.390 --> 30:39.337
It's not even enough
for one brown sugar cake.

30:39.410 --> 30:41.170
Just give me everything you've got.

30:41.360 --> 30:42.680
I'll pay you back double.

30:44.780 --> 30:45.660
Really?

30:45.660 --> 30:46.520
Of course.

30:46.780 --> 30:47.820
If you don't believe me,

30:47.820 --> 30:49.470
I'll leave my sketchbook as collateral.

30:49.650 --> 30:50.890
I've got no use for that.

30:55.937 --> 30:57.120
When my grandma gets back,

30:57.120 --> 30:59.660
I'll buy you a chocolate and cream cake.

30:59.900 --> 31:01.280
No need to treat me.

31:01.280 --> 31:02.150
Just pay me back.

31:02.300 --> 31:03.060
Thanks.

31:04.950 --> 31:05.690
Here.

31:06.170 --> 31:07.900
Borrowed five cents,
paying back ten.

31:08.340 --> 31:08.980
Double, right?

31:09.320 --> 31:09.860
Okay.

31:11.915 --> 31:13.450
Can you lend me another twenty cents?

31:14.010 --> 31:14.940
I'll pay you back forty,

31:14.940 --> 31:16.500
and treat you to a brown sugar pancake.

31:18.780 --> 31:20.170
You're broke again?

31:20.280 --> 31:21.430
Didn't I just repay you?

31:21.820 --> 31:23.950
Besides, I'll have money
once my grandma's back.

31:25.680 --> 31:26.890
Skip the pancake.

31:27.020 --> 31:28.200
By your rules,

31:28.200 --> 31:29.230
just pay me forty.

31:30.020 --> 31:31.300
A promise is a promise.

31:32.020 --> 31:32.950
When?

31:34.390 --> 31:35.030
Sunday.

31:35.500 --> 31:36.330
I'll come find you.

31:37.290 --> 31:38.070
Where do you live?

31:38.620 --> 31:42.220
(Jiangcheng No. 1
Textile Factory Family Quarters)

31:44.580 --> 31:46.370
Come on, let's go play at Jingshan Park.

31:46.370 --> 31:47.610
- Okay.
- Okay.

31:47.810 --> 31:48.640
My mom said

31:48.640 --> 31:50.580
Jingshan Park is gorgeous
this time of year.

31:50.810 --> 31:51.450
Yeah!

31:51.630 --> 31:53.500
My mom said
all the flowers are blooming.

31:53.700 --> 31:54.630
Then let's go.

31:54.630 --> 31:55.370
Come on!

31:56.370 --> 31:57.580
Fei Ni, you coming?

31:58.480 --> 32:00.020
I'll pass. You guys go ahead.

32:00.560 --> 32:01.715
- Okay!
- Let's go!

32:43.370 --> 32:45.700
Fei Ni, dinner's ready.

32:51.520 --> 32:54.170
I won't bother
with all those years of interest.

32:54.170 --> 32:55.590
You've got money now.

32:55.590 --> 32:57.330
Why don't we settle up?

32:59.090 --> 32:59.810
I don't remember.

33:01.780 --> 33:02.690
Fine.

33:03.440 --> 33:05.120
You will someday.

33:11.580 --> 33:12.580
Fang Muyang.

33:13.160 --> 33:14.930
I already washed these.

33:14.930 --> 33:16.210
Why did you wash them again?

33:17.740 --> 33:19.370
You said I should learn.

33:21.360 --> 33:21.800
I...

33:23.460 --> 33:24.780
I told you to learn,

33:25.590 --> 33:26.930
not ruin them.

33:27.480 --> 33:30.580
How am I supposed to fix this now?

33:33.960 --> 33:35.100
And you're laughing?

33:41.580 --> 33:42.240
Ni.

33:42.240 --> 33:42.840
Yeah?

33:44.210 --> 33:45.430
What are you doing?

33:45.430 --> 33:47.370
Those are from ten years ago.

33:47.370 --> 33:48.740
Why dig them out?

33:49.610 --> 33:52.610
I'm making Fang Muyang a shirt.

33:53.170 --> 33:54.300
Be serious.

33:54.490 --> 33:56.900
Look at his build,

33:56.900 --> 33:57.960
and look at mine.

33:58.880 --> 34:00.880
I'll just add a bit to the length.

34:04.300 --> 34:04.800
Well,

34:05.500 --> 34:08.510
my daughter's got
brains and good hands.

34:49.540 --> 34:53.460
(Save the Dying, Heal the Wounded
Serving Workers and Peasants)

34:56.160 --> 34:57.520
The fabric's old,

34:58.200 --> 35:00.810
but buying new cloth
and making one from scratch

35:00.810 --> 35:01.930
would cost a lot.

35:01.930 --> 35:03.493
And you don't have fabric coupons.

35:04.480 --> 35:05.410
So?

35:06.040 --> 35:06.900
It's unique.

35:07.490 --> 35:08.500
Nice color too.

35:09.170 --> 35:10.070
Color...

35:10.700 --> 35:11.410
Mom,

35:11.510 --> 35:13.480
where are the cloth scraps?

35:17.510 --> 35:18.260
Looks good, right?

35:18.670 --> 35:20.090
I picked it out carefully.

35:20.920 --> 35:22.220
Since you seem happy with it,

35:22.400 --> 35:24.204
I'll charge you two yuan.

35:27.220 --> 35:28.050
What?

35:28.670 --> 35:30.920
It'd cost more in a shop.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.248
I'm already giving you a deal.

35:32.893 --> 35:33.710
I don't want it.

35:33.710 --> 35:34.700
Wait, wait.

35:35.520 --> 35:37.480
One fifty. That's my final offer.

35:42.020 --> 35:43.050
Fang Muyang.

35:44.170 --> 35:45.950
So you've learned to bargain now?

35:46.010 --> 35:46.730
You taught me.

35:49.180 --> 35:49.700
Fair enough.

35:49.700 --> 35:51.550
That's a useful skill.

35:52.040 --> 35:52.830
You'll need it.

35:54.580 --> 35:56.200
Look at this.

35:57.010 --> 35:58.410
I restocked everything for you.

35:59.610 --> 36:01.560
Draw and think wisely.

36:01.920 --> 36:03.270
Or I've wasted my money.

36:03.740 --> 36:04.300
I have money.

36:04.720 --> 36:06.050
That doesn't mean you waste it.

36:06.330 --> 36:07.060
Wait.

36:08.480 --> 36:09.490
I'll draw you.

36:12.190 --> 36:13.250
Why me?

36:13.540 --> 36:14.730
You told me to draw.

36:16.970 --> 36:17.530
I...

36:17.890 --> 36:18.410
Fine.

36:33.860 --> 36:34.560
Turn a bit.

36:57.620 --> 36:58.370
Fang Muyang,

36:59.090 --> 37:00.100
you really don't remember

37:00.100 --> 37:01.460
anything from school?

37:03.180 --> 37:04.660
You scared me with that dead fly,

37:05.010 --> 37:06.220
and I twisted my ankle.

37:06.430 --> 37:09.420
And that time you splashed mud
all over me on your bike.

37:09.980 --> 37:11.940
With genes like yours,

37:12.000 --> 37:13.650
your mom's a university lecturer,

37:13.650 --> 37:15.210
your dad's a famous painter,

37:15.210 --> 37:16.920
how did none of that pass on to you?

37:16.920 --> 37:18.271
You even had to repeat a year.

37:36.260 --> 37:37.780
You look good when you smile.

37:37.940 --> 37:41.740
♪Summer, by my ears♪

37:42.300 --> 37:46.100
♪The wind sweeps
through the wheat fields♪

37:47.140 --> 37:51.460
♪Cicadas sing on the treetops♪

37:51.580 --> 37:55.020
♪Writing the language of youth♪

37:55.700 --> 37:59.220
♪Smiles in my eyes♪

37:59.860 --> 38:03.700
♪Sweet as if dipped in honey♪

38:04.660 --> 38:08.260
♪Watching the sunset♪

38:08.300 --> 38:12.500
♪Stain the passing years red♪

38:13.380 --> 38:16.940
♪Talk a little, listen a little♪

38:17.060 --> 38:20.940
♪Let time settle♪

38:22.180 --> 38:25.820
♪Feel the warm breeze♪

38:26.020 --> 38:29.300
♪Carry us into tomorrow♪

38:29.300 --> 38:30.220
For you.

38:31.220 --> 38:34.540
♪When someday, some promise♪

38:37.660 --> 38:39.740
Your drawing is amazing.

38:40.260 --> 38:43.180
It looks just like a studio photograph.

38:43.510 --> 38:45.270
How much does a photo cost at a studio?

38:46.660 --> 38:48.660
For one this size,

38:48.660 --> 38:50.780
about one yuan.

38:52.360 --> 38:53.510
I'll charge you fifty cents.

38:57.010 --> 38:58.900
Fang Muyang,
now you're making money off me?

38:58.960 --> 39:00.180
You taught me.

39:00.890 --> 39:02.260
You messing with me?

39:02.510 --> 39:04.170
At this rate,

39:04.170 --> 39:05.490
your memory should be back soon.

39:05.720 --> 39:07.182
I'll draw you every day.

39:07.410 --> 39:07.980
No charge.

39:11.920 --> 39:12.390
No need.

39:13.430 --> 39:14.500
One is enough.

39:14.960 --> 39:16.320
Some things

39:16.715 --> 39:18.271
are more precious with rarity.

39:19.950 --> 39:20.860
I like it.

39:21.240 --> 39:21.860
Thanks.

39:28.410 --> 39:28.860
Oh, right,

39:29.550 --> 39:31.440
I'll take you to
meet someone this weekend.

39:31.790 --> 39:32.320
Okay.

39:33.780 --> 39:35.426
You don't want to know who?

39:36.680 --> 39:37.660
Not really.

39:38.830 --> 39:40.240
I wouldn't remember anyway.

39:42.560 --> 39:44.180
I'll grab you a carrot.

40:08.710 --> 40:09.660
Everyone, watch closely.

40:09.671 --> 40:11.410
(Fei Ting)
Planting rice seedlings is simple.

40:11.600 --> 40:13.700
Shallow water, shallow planting.

40:13.700 --> 40:15.093
Plant them steadily and straight.

40:15.137 --> 40:16.680
One thing to watch out for

40:16.760 --> 40:19.050
is not to plant them too deeply.

40:19.500 --> 40:21.770
They'll drown in a few days.

40:21.915 --> 40:22.804
One more thing.

40:23.200 --> 40:24.980
Mind the gap between each seedling...

40:24.980 --> 40:26.640
Fei Ting, Fei Ting.

40:28.300 --> 40:29.400
Your partner's on the phone.

40:29.610 --> 40:30.890
Go take it at the commune.

40:31.530 --> 40:31.990
Coming.

40:33.390 --> 40:34.220
You all try first.

40:44.830 --> 40:45.380
Hello?

40:46.070 --> 40:46.640
Fei Ting,

40:47.330 --> 40:48.400
is the return report ready?

40:49.520 --> 40:50.200
I...

40:51.200 --> 40:51.780
I got it.

40:52.190 --> 40:53.180
I got it ready.

40:54.100 --> 40:55.270
So why no updates?

40:55.850 --> 40:58.870
No. There's been
a lot of work in the fields lately.

40:59.240 --> 41:00.260
Everyone's swamped.

41:00.560 --> 41:02.400
The regiment leader
hasn't had time for this.

41:02.620 --> 41:04.080
Maybe give it a bit longer.

41:04.080 --> 41:05.570
Don't dodge the question.

41:05.570 --> 41:07.490
Your fracture never healed properly.

41:07.515 --> 41:09.048
Your medical discharge was approved.

41:09.071 --> 41:10.150
Is the leader too busy,

41:10.150 --> 41:11.820
or did you never submit the report?

41:18.060 --> 41:19.340
Fei Ting, be honest with me.

41:20.130 --> 41:21.620
Did you never plan to come back?

41:22.250 --> 41:23.890
Did you never plan to marry me?

41:24.240 --> 41:26.100
If that's the case, just say it.

41:26.100 --> 41:27.250
If we're done, so be it.

41:27.350 --> 41:28.800
I'm not clinging to you.

41:31.080 --> 41:32.404
Go find someone else then.

41:32.820 --> 41:33.690
I'm not going back.

41:38.880 --> 41:39.790
Fine. I will.

41:51.460 --> 41:56.740
(Jiangcheng University)

41:56.740 --> 41:57.780
Spread out.

42:04.620 --> 42:05.820
Stop reading for a second.

42:05.820 --> 42:07.740
The one who just scored was Ye Feng.

42:09.360 --> 42:12.448
His mom's the administration director
at Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory.

42:24.660 --> 42:26.050
Come on, let's return the books.

42:30.700 --> 42:31.300
Hua,

42:31.570 --> 42:33.370
I just remembered
I've got something to do.

42:33.370 --> 42:34.410
Can you return them for me?

42:34.620 --> 42:35.140
Sure.

42:46.450 --> 42:47.740
Move it to the side.

42:48.140 --> 42:48.690
To the side.

42:49.140 --> 42:50.380
Shift it over!

42:53.370 --> 42:54.140
Careful.

42:56.530 --> 42:57.700
Hey, are you okay?

43:02.320 --> 43:03.050
I'm fine.

43:05.640 --> 43:06.820
Fine? It's already red.

43:08.090 --> 43:09.580
Zu, cover for me a sec.

43:10.050 --> 43:11.450
Let's go to the infirmary. Come.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
